  "testFiles": [
    {
      "path": "tests/runtime-config.test.mjs",
      "names": [
        "opaque raw CAS tokens are independent of source application tokens and absent-file raw null is valid",
        "missing application tokens stay unavailable while two present unequal tokens are unapplied",
        "snapshot validity requires a source token and invalid snapshots cannot carry one",
        "reconciliation rejects each different organization instance generation installation and release binding",
        "an observation before the receipt is rejected and an equal-time observation is allowed",
        "set reports persistence only even when a later matching snapshot observes application",
        "apply and patch preserve restart-required reported-applied and unavailable restart evidence",
        "committed-unapplied retains its receipt outcome when a matching later read observes application",
        "a successful no-op never credits persistence or recovery from a later applied snapshot",
        "empty changed paths without noop still reports an authored persistence attempt",
        "raw revision mismatch or missing CAS loses write attribution without hiding current application",
        "rejection and publication failure establish no persistence even beside a later applied snapshot",
        "lost acknowledgment and generic unavailable outcomes cannot impersonate committed receipts",
        "strict records reject extra credential config inherited hidden symbol and accessor properties without reads",
        "changed path arrays must be dense ordinary unique enumerable data without accessor reads",
        "malformed identities generations timestamps text and bounded arrays fail without truncation",
        "normalizers and reconciliation return frozen detached data without mutating or freezing inputs",
        "receipt shape rules and exact reconciliation DTOs reject nullable fields and enriched outputs"
      ]
    }
  ],
